From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Kopco <hey@oddcelot.dev>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:15:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bun_core, pod: wasm branches for OS-specific paths

Exit and signal paths abort; clock reads 0; entropy uses a fixed seed; msync, poll, AT_FDCWD, strlen, strncasecmp and thread ids get wasm variants. is_writable and reload_process are unimplemented. Env var keys use the POSIX names. Items only used on other platforms allow dead_code on wasm.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
